{"sequence":31,"row_sha256":"8a198c52a897ed9872273d614d17b26a851eab140e3a6c5695b57b199eb44226","row_occurrence":1,"received_date":"2026-10-28","received_at":"2026-10-28T13:42:00+09:00","sender":"권명옥","sender_evidence":{"received_date":"2026-10-28","verification_method":"manual-visible-header-screenshot","visible_header":"권명옥 · 2026-10-28 13:42","visible_list_label":"권명옥 / 2026-10-28 13:42","manually_verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-11-02"},"body":"[소방훈련 안내]\n\n내일(28일) 자체 소방훈련을 실시하고자 합니다.\n소방벨이 울리면 계단을 이용해 운동장으로 대피해주시면 됩니다.\n관련 계획서는 공문을 참조해주세요(화천초-11257(2026. 10. 28.))\n\n1. 훈련일시: 2026. 10. 29.(목), 13:40~14:00\n2. 훈련상황: 교내 화재발생에 따른 대피 \n3. 대피장소: 운동장\n\n많은 협조 부탁드립니다.^^","body_sha256":"25604d89c468cc4ea58f79aec6cbcdf4b81a9a44c6d0563ccb4ec6e6dd2d7290","uia_body_sha256":"152cafec76824e5501059e486ba2046b6475ca62a4e9881304a85306c06e9a57","captured_at":"2026-11-02","source":"gbtalk-message-manager-pywinauto-uia-down-key","capture_status":"captured"}
